<p class="mt-indent-1">\(PV=nRT \rightarrow P=\frac{nRT}{V}=(0.182\,M)(0.08206\frac{L\cdot atm}{mol\cdot K})((425+273.15)\,K)=10.427\,atm\)</p>

<p class="mt-indent-2">\([H_{2}]=3.64 \times 10^{-1}\,mol\,H_{2} \times \frac{1}{2.0\,L}=0.182\,M\)</p>

